            "content_html": "<h1>skills-学习和使用研究记录</h1>\n<!--\n * @?: *********************************************************************\n * @Author: Weidows\n * @LastEditors: Weidows\n * @LastEditTime: 2026-06-05 00:04:00\n * @FilePath: \\Blog-private\\source\\_posts\\ai\\skills.md\n * @Description:\n * @:\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡏⠻⣄\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣀⡾⠀⠀⣿\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⣠⡶⠟⠛⠉⠉⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠉⠉⠛⠻⠿⣤⣀⣠⡴⠋\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⣴⠟⠉⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣤⠂⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠙⢶⣀\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⡾⠉⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡴⠁⠀⠀⠀⡞⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠈⠳⣄\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣴⠋⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢠⠏⠀⠀⠀⠀⡾⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢰⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠈⢷⡀\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣠⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀⢰⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠙⣄\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀⣀⣿⢠⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣶⠀⣧⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠈⣆\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣼⠁⠀⣰⠀⠀⠀⠀⣾⢸⣿⣀⣤⣶⡛⠁⣿⠘⡄⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⠀⠀⣿⠀⢻⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠸\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣿⠀⠀⡟⠀⠀⠀⠀⣿⡈⡏⠀⠀⠀⠀⠙⡜⡄⢿⠀⠀⠀⠀⣾⣧⣾⢸⠀⢸⠀⠀⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡇\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⡇⠀⠀⣇⠀⠀⠀⠀⣷⣿⣿⣶⣦⣀⠀⠀⠀⠹⡘⣿⡀⠀⠀⢹⣿⠃⢸⠀⣿⠀⢠⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣄⣧\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣼⠀⠀⠀⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀⢿⠉⠉⠉⠻⣿⣷⡀⠀⠀⠈⠁⠙⢦⣀⣸⠋⠈⣸⣼⢻⠀⣾⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀⢸⢸⣿\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣿⠀⣿⠀⠸⡄⣤⠀⠀⠀⣧⠀⠀⠀⠀⠉⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠉⠀⠀⣿⣿⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀⣾⢸⣿\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢰⡇⠀⣿⠀⠀⠙⠿⣿⠛⠒⠛⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣾⣿⣿⣿⣿⣦⡀⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣿⣿⣿\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣿⠀⣴⠋⠙⣦⠀⠀⠀⣇⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣼⠉⠙⠳⠦⣤⡀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠈⠻⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣿⣿⣿\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣿⢤⠇⣀⡀⣼⠀⠀⠀⢹⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢸⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⢰⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣠⠟⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢠⣯⣿⣿\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⣠⠋⣠⠟⠁⠀⠈⠛⣄⠀⠀⠀⣇⠀⠀⠀⠀⢹⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⠟⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢾⣁⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⣾⣤⡏⠉⠉⣿\n * ⠀⠀⢀⣞⠤⣴⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣧⠀⠀⢿⠉⠳⣤⡀⠀⠁⠀⠠⠶⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠉⠧⣴⣾⣿⣿⠟⡇⠀⠀⢸\n * ⣠⠚⠁⢀⠏⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠸⡀⠀⠈⡏⠛⠶⣤⡉⠛⠶⢤⣤⣀⡀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣀⡴⣿⣿⠟⠁⠀⠀⡇⠀⠀⢸\n * ⠀⠀⠀⢸⠀⠘⡄⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢹⠀⡿⡄⠀⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠙⠲⣤⡀⠙⢦⠉⠉⠉⠉⠉⠉⠁⠀⠀⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡇⠀⠀⢸\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠘⡄⠀⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣸⠛⡄⢻⠀⠸⡀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠈⠛⢦⡉⢦⡀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀⢰⠇⠀⠀⢸\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⢿⠀⠈⠙⢦⣄⣠⠴⠃⢠⠃⠀⡇⠀⣇⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠙⢾⣦⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀⣼⠀⠀⠀⠀⡇\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠙⢤⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡴⠋⠀⠀⡇⠀⢿⡀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠈⠳⣄⠀⠀⠀⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀⡇\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⡇⠀⠘⣿⣿⣄⡀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠳⠀⠀⡇⠀⠀⠀⢰⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⡇\n * ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡾⠀⠀⠀⣿⣿⣿⣿⣷⣶⣶⣤⣄⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢸⠁⠀⠀⠀⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣷\n *\n * @!: *********************************************************************\n-->\n<blockquote class=\"pullquote mindmap mindmap-sm\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"#skills-%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E5%92%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95\">skills-学习和使用研究记录</a>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#skill-%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93\">skill-本体</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#skill-%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85\">skill-检索安装</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#skill-%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86\">skill-版本管理</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#skill-%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90\">skill-推荐</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%E5%80%9F%E7%89%A9%E8%A1%A8\">借物表</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a><img src= \"https://pan.weidows.tech/d/local/img/loading.svg\" data-lazy-src=\"https://pan.weidows.tech/d/local/img/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"skill-本体\">skill-本体</h2>\n<p>实际每个 skill 就是一个文件, 有的作者习惯一个库里放一个 skill, 有的是一个库里多个 skill</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/skills\">https://github.com/anthropics/skills</a> <br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/azure-skills\">https://github.com/microsoft/azure-skills</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>仓库命名各不相同, 没有什么规范, 但是如果是一库多 skill, 大家都会创建一个 <code>skills</code> 子文件夹来放多个 skill</p>\n<h2 id=\"skill-检索安装\">skill-检索安装</h2>\n<p>skill 仓库实际不太容易被人自己搜到, 大多是从 x/B站/小红书 等平台弄来的流量, 所以基本都是流量派, skill 质量参差不齐</p>\n<p>安装方式大概有几个类型</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>agent 自带 / 内部安装, 比如 claudecode / hermes / openclaw</p>\n<p>hermes / openclaw 安装后会自带一些 skill</p>\n<p>claudecode 通过 <code>/plugin marketplace add xxx</code> 的方式, 以插件的形式安装 skill</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>cc-switch, 它接管了 marketplace, 也可以单独找 <a href=\"https://skills.sh\">https://skills.sh</a> 上面的安装</p>\n<p>可以对不同 agent 独立控制 skill 开关, 实现方式是软连接</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"skill-版本管理\">skill-版本管理</h2>\n<p>TODO.</p>\n<p><a><img src= \"https://pan.weidows.tech/d/local/img/loading.svg\" data-lazy-src=\"https://pan.weidows.tech/d/local/img/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"skill-推荐\">skill-推荐</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RcRmBbE3x/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=bc13275071d678583f4bfdd8d344efda\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RcRmBbE3x/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=bc13275071d678583f4bfdd8d344efda</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.skills.sh/trending\">https://www.skills.sh/trending</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<figure class=\"highlight dockerfile\"><table><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">npx skills <span class=\"keyword\">add</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills --skill find-skills</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">npx skills <span class=\"keyword\">add</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> anthropics/skills</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">npx skills <span class=\"keyword\">add</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> https://github.com/remotion-dev/skills --skill remotion-best-practices</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">npx skills <span class=\"keyword\">add</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> https://github.com/Weidows/skills</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">npx skills <span class=\"keyword\">add</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> obra/superpowers</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">npx skills <span class=\"keyword\">add</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> https://github.com/mattpocock/skills --skill grill-me</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p><a><img src= \"https://pan.weidows.tech/d/local/img/loading.svg\" data-lazy-src=\"https://pan.weidows.tech/d/local/img/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"借物表\">借物表</h2>\n<p>暂无.</p>\n<script type=\"text&#x2F;javascript\" src=\"https://unpkg.com/kity@2.0.4/dist/kity.min.js\"></script><script type=\"text&#x2F;javascript\" src=\"https://unpkg.com/kityminder-core@1.4.50/dist/kityminder.core.min.js\"></script><script type=\"text&#x2F;javascript\" src=\"/mindmap/mindmap.js\"></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text&#x2F;css\" href=\"/mindmap/mindmap.css\">",
